---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Niyam aur Shartein - Zcompressor Terms & Conditions"
  description="Zcompressor ke Terms & Conditions padhein. Hamare local browser sandbox processing, upayog ki shartein aur liability disclaimers ke baare me samjhein."
  ogUrl="https://zcompressor.com/hi/terms"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-canvas-soft text-ink py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span
          class="text-caption-mono font-mono text-link-deep dark:text-cyan-deep uppercase tracking-wider block mb-3"
        >
          Kanooni Niyam (Legal Agreement)
        </span>
        <h1
          class="text-display-lg md:text-display-xl text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-1.5px] md:tracking-[-2.4px] mb-4"
        >
          Niyam aur Shartein (Terms).
        </h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body">
          Last updated: June 26, 2026. Zcompressor use karne se pehle kripya in sharaton ko dhyan se padhein.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <article class="space-y-10">
        <section>
          <h2
            class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4"
          >
            1. Sharaton ki Sweekriti (Acceptance).
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            Zcompressor (the "Service") access ya use karke, aap in sabhi Niyam aur Sharaton se bandhe rehne ki sehmati dete hain. Agar aap in sharaton se sehmat nahi hain, to kripya is tool ka upayog na karein.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4"
          >
            2. Service ka Vivaran.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed">
            Zcompressor ek free, web-based utility tool hai jo users ko PDF documents ko optimize aur compress karne ki suvidha deta hai. Puri compression process aapke web browser me HTML5 aur client-side JavaScript se chalti hai. Zcompressor ke servers par koi bhi file na to upload hoti hai aur na hi store hoti hai.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4"
          >
            3. Disclaimer of Warranties.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Zcompressor "AS IS" aur "AS AVAILABLE" basis par pradan kiya jaata hai, bina kisi guarantee ya warranty ke.
          </p>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed font-semibold">
            Hum ye guarantee nahi dete ki:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body-md text-body mb-6">
            <li>Service bina kisi rukawat ke hamesha available rahegi.</li>
            <li>Har tarah ki corrupted PDF theek ho jayegi.</li>
            <li>Har ek portal ya exam board ki specific size limits bina user check kiye satisfy ho jayegi (users ko upload karne se pehle size verify karna chahiye).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4"
          >
            4. Limitation of Liability.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Zcompressor ya iske developers kisi bhi indirect, aakasmik ya nuksan ke liye utardayi nahi honge:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body-md text-body mb-6">
            <li>Service ke upayog ya anupayog se hone wale nuksan par.</li>
            <li>Client-side compression ke dauran file me aane wale kisi bhi anapekshit parinam par.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2
            class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4"
          >
            5. User ki Zimmedari.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Kyuki Zcompressor sara code aapke system par run karta hai, isliye user ke roop me aap zimmedar hain:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-body-md text-body mb-6">
            <li>Apne system me heavy PDF process karne ke liye zaroori RAM aur CPU performance sunishchit karne ke liye.</li>
            <li>File process karne se pehle apni original copy ka backup safe rakhne ke liye.</li>
            <li>Apne documents se jude sabhi kanoon aur regulatory rules ka palan karne ke liye.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="border-t border-hairline pt-8">
          <h2
            class="text-display-md text-ink font-semibold tracking-[-0.96px] mb-4"
          >
            Sampark Karein.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-body-md text-body leading-relaxed mb-4">
            In sharaton ke baare me sawal poochne ke liye hamse contact karein.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/hi/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 border border-hairline rounded bg-canvas text-body-sm-strong text-ink hover:bg-canvas-soft-2/50 transition-colors shadow-level-2 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:outline-none"
          >
            Hamse Sampark Karein
          </a>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
